      "source": "https://kanarraville.gov/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Settlers founded Kanarraville around 1861 after heavy rains and floods destroyed their previous settlement at Fort Harmony.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        12,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://kanarraville.gov/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A severe windstorm in 1865 buried homes in sand, prompting the community to relocate one mile south in 1866.",
